D -> S3 : PUT photo bytes
alt reply received
 S3 --> D : x-amz-version-id
else PUT reply lost
 D -> API : GET intent; POST …/:id/reconcile
 ref over API,S3 : reconcileUploadIntent(): exactly one matching version
 API --> D : pinned version / failure
end
D -> API : POST …/upload-intents/:id/complete {versionId}
ref over API,S3 : seq-capture-accept · pin, probe, atomic acceptance
API --> D : completed receipt
